# model-effort

Effort as a word of ours, and the shapes this bay's model offers.

- [x] model.yml: quick (no thinking) and considered (1024 tokens of thinking, server-enforced, then the answer)
- [x] considered never ends empty: an empty answer is asked again at quick, and says so
- [x] shapes/: model+hello, model+poem (prompt, limit, answer length, effort word); fcpm model shapes
- [x] fcpm model ask -Shape / -Effort; tried against the running server
- [ ] digitization matches the table and the shapes; the join publishes shapes/
- [ ] the queue: considered's long waits wait in line, not in a held-open request
